OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will continue in the far
OL,7,Fnorthwest, but a dry night elsewhere
OL,8,Fwith clear skies. Staying mild perhaps
OL,9,Fwith a few mist patches developing by
OL,10,Fdawn. Winds becoming rather gusty
OL,11,Facross northeast England for a time.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy in western Scotland
OL,14,Fand western parts of Northern Ireland
OL,15,Fwith showers, turning heavy at times.
OL,16,FA dry and sunny day elsewhere with hot
OL,17,Fsunshine, particularly across England
OL,18,Fand Wales.
